- Cost/pricing: Parent open-weights = $0 licensing; commercial hosting varies. Dataset tracking shows Lite cost ratings 95-100 (agent ratings) and commercial hosting reference ~$0.15/$0.60 per 1M — no conflict with parent open-weights/free-license design.

